From: openEuler RISC-V packaging
Subject: [PATCH] End variadic argument lists before returning
SPDX-License-Identifier: ISC

Nine public wrappers returned before va_end. Save the result, end the
argument list, then return it. No default build, test or API is removed.
Original downstream fix for 1.0.3.1; not submitted upstream. Remove after
an official release pairs these va_start/va_end calls on the return path.

--- a/libenv_filter_name_list.c
+++ b/libenv_filter_name_list.c
@@ -7,0 +8 @@
+	size_t result;
@@ -10 +11 @@
-	return libenv_vfilter_name_list(variables, classes);
+	result = libenv_vfilter_name_list(variables, classes);
@@ -11,0 +13 @@
+	return result;
--- a/libenv_filter_name_list_with_dealloc.c
+++ b/libenv_filter_name_list_with_dealloc.c
